# 默认统一 LF；Windows 入口脚本保留 CRLF，避免跨平台提交产生整文件噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
*.gguf binary
*.ggml binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
